  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI). If the sequence $a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}, \\ldots$ converges, then the series $a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+\\ldots$ converges.\n\nII). If the sequence $a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}, \\ldots$ diverges, then the series $a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+\\ldots$ diverges.\n\nIII). If the series $a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+\\ldots$ converges, then the sequence $a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}, \\ldots$ converges.\n\nIV). If the series $a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+\\ldots$ diverges, then the sequence $a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}, \\ldots$ diverges.",
    "solution": [
      1
    ],
